      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">From Topsail to Seal Cove, we replace and remove heating oil tanks along the whole CBS shoreline. Free written estimates, and a 24/7 line if your tag's expired or your tank is leaking.</p>
