<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Conception Bay South runs a long way along the shore, from Topsail and Chamberlains through Manuels, Long Pond and Foxtrap out to Kelligrews, Upper Gullies and Seal Cove. Thousands of those homes are 1970s to 1990s bungalows that still heat with oil, and a lot of the tanks sit outside in the salt air and wind off the bay. Harbour Tank Co arranges oil tank replacement and removal across CBS, with free written estimates and a crew that's licensed and insured.</p><p>If the delivery driver read your tag, shook his head and pulled away, you're not the first in CBS this year and you won't be the last. Call (709) 800-3117 and you'll get a straight answer, a written price and a date. Our <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-st-johns/">oil tank replacement</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-removal-st-johns/">oil tank removal</a> pages explain how the work goes.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Conception Bay South</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Conception Bay South Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement in CBS</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">New steel or fibreglass tanks installed at homes from Topsail to Seal Cove, tagged and registered by the installer's licensed inspector so your next delivery goes through. The old tank leaves on the same truck.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Fibreglass Oil Tank Upgrade</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Salt air off Conception Bay is the main thing that finishes outdoor steel along the shore. Fibreglass doesn't rust and its tag runs decades longer, which makes it a sensible pick for an exposed lot in Long Pond or Kelligrews.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Removal and Disposal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Moved to a heat pump and still have a rusty tank beside the house? We drain it, disconnect it, cap the lines and haul it away, so it's out of your yard and off your insurance file.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Expired Tag and Leaking Tank Emergencies</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Refused delivery with a cold house, or oil on the ground? Our 24/7 emergency line covers all of Conception Bay South. Call (709) 800-3117 any hour.</p>
      </div>
</div>
